    "assessment": "new_security_rating is E because of six issues that are all false positives on non-production code: four pythonsecurity:S2083 path-injection reports in local probe scripts where the path comes from tempfile.TemporaryDirectory, and two rust:S2612 permissive-permission reports in crates/project-adapter/tests/cargo_vendor.rs, a test that deliberately sets 0o666/0o777 to assert the vendor validator rejects them. new_coverage is 54.3 percent against an 80 percent threshold because the scanner runs on Linux while the mutation store, the quality artifact store and the guest execution paths are macOS ARM64 and APFS only; sonar-project.properties already records the owner's decision not to turn unavailable host paths into fake coverage. new_duplicated_lines_density is 4.0 percent against a 3 percent threshold over the new M2 and M3 code. Resolving any of the three requires an owner decision on scanner scope, gate thresholds or a large body of new portable tests."
  },
